        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1827] In scheduled control mode, when the grid code only demands a specific reactive power behavior (e.g. resulting from a Q(U) rule, see IEEE 1547-2018 or other regional/national regulations), the SECC shall only send an EVSETargetReactivePower element without a corresponding EVSETargetActivePower element.",
